  "document": "Holden-Keating Gang\nThe Holden-Keating Gang was a bank robbing team, led by Thomas James Holden (1896–1953) and Francis Keating (1899–July 25, 1978), which was active in the Midwestern United States during the 1925 and 1939. Holden was described by a spokesman for the FBI as \"a menace to every man, woman and child in America\" and was the first fugitive to be officially listed on the FBI's Top Ten Most Wanted List in 1950."
